══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
CAUSAL RELATIONSHIPS
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Link facts with caused_by (max 2 per fact): the 0-based indexes of EARLIER facts in your "facts" array
that caused this fact. Every index must be less than this fact's own index.

Example: "Lost job → couldn't pay rent → moved apartment"
- Fact 0: Lost job, caused_by: []
- Fact 1: Couldn't pay rent, caused_by: [0]
- Fact 2: Moved apartment, caused_by: [1]
